<view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="heading">板块雷达</view><button class="icon-button" bindtap="settings" aria-label="设置"><image class="icon" src="/assets/settings.png" /></button></view>
<view class="toolbar wrap"><button bindtap="market">市场环境</button><button bindtap="capital">资金证据</button><button bindtap="sentiment">情绪参考</button></view>
<view class="toolbar"><input class="grow" value="{{query}}" bindinput="field" data-field="query" placeholder="搜索板块" /><button class="icon-button" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}" aria-label="读取板块证据"><image class="icon" src="/assets/refresh.png" /></button></view>
<view class="field"><picker range="{{sorts}}" value="{{sort}}" bindchange="field" data-field="sort"><view class="select">{{sorts[sort]}}</view></picker></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取板块证据…</view>
<view wx:for="{{visible}}" wx:key="id" class="item" bindtap="detail" data-id="{{item.id}}" aria-label="{{item.title}}"><view class="row"><view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view><image class="icon" src="/assets/chevron.png" /></view><view class="prose">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="footnote">{{item.meta}}</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!loading&&!visible.length}}" class="empty">暂无匹配板块</view><view class="footnote">资金为已覆盖 ETF 样本净申购估算，不是全行业资金。热点关联沿用标准主题标签；热门不等于未来上涨。板块价格序列尚未接入。</view></view>
